    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##CodeConnect Website Idea Generator\r\n\r\nFollow these simple steps to get the most out of your collaboration:\r\n\r\n**1. Start:** Tell the AI your niche hobby to kick off the brainstorm (_\"We're building a page on competitive duck herding!\"_).\r\n\r\n**2. Explore:** Review the AI's suggestions and pick your favorite direction.\r\n\r\n**3. Upload Media:** Don't just type! Feed the AI different types of media to guide the design process. Upload sketches. Share vibe photos. Upload supporting documents.\r\n\r\n**4. Iterate:** Treat the AI like a creative partner. If you want more specific features, ask for them directly. ",
